:null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5790,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-13T04:51:40Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:10:19Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124421","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124421","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124421.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124421.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"I found this bug while adding gizmos to my BoneCloth addon.\n\nThe cause is the second for loop in `SpringBoneCollision3DGizmoPlugin::draw_capsule`, which draws the half circles by rotating points around `Vector3::FORWARD`. `FORWARD` is (0, 0, -1), so the top half circle bulges downward (and the bottom one bulges upward).\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1494\" alt=\"before_master_editor\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/be687806-cae8-4ba3-b76e-2da2eb080dd6\" />\nLeft: `SpringBoneCollisionCapsule3D`. Right: a `CollisionShape3D` of the same size.\n\nGoing through the history, up to 4.5 this was `VECTOR3_FORWARD = Vector3(0, 0, 1)` and it worked correctly. Commit 84c0ec04f3 (\"Core: Integrate semantic constants in math structs\"), which landed in 4.6, replaced it with `Vector3::FORWARD`, and that flipped the direction. The other places it changed are fine; only the second for loop is affected.\n\nCollision itself is not affected. Only the gizmo drawing is wrong.\n\nAfter changing it to `Vector3::BACK`:\n\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1494\" alt=\"after_master_editor\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/af3f673c-6a66-4ae8-aa71-569053bcf316\" />\n\n---\n\nAI usage: I used AI to go through the git history, to translate this description from Korean, and to help track down the bug.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124421/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124421/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}